### Step 1: Initialize Masks (Lines 96-99)

```python
noisy_batch = input_ids.clone()           # Clone 1 for forward masking
noisy_batch_rev = input_ids.clone()       # Clone 2 for complementary masking
masked_indices = torch.zeros_like(input_ids, dtype=torch.bool)
