**What happens:**
- `noisy_batch`: Will have [MASK] tokens where `masked_indices=True`
- `noisy_batch_rev`: Will have [MASK] tokens where `masked_indices_rev=True`
- `masked_indices`: Boolean mask marking positions to mask in forward path
- `masked_indices_rev`: Boolean mask marking positions to mask in complementary path

